                "text": "As a doctor and public health expert, my colleague @RepRaulRuizMD knows what\u2019s at stake when healthcare access is threatened. This bill will have devastating consequences for over 17 million Americans\u2014especially those in rural communities, where hospitals are already scarce.\n\n\ud83c\udfe5 No one\u2019s loved one should be at greater risk simply because they live far from a hospital.\n\nThis is unacceptable.",
