                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Health care is on the line in this shutdown fight. The Big Ugly Bill puts 245,929 people in my district at risk of losing coverage. I am standing up for seniors, kids, and working families in Prince George\u2019s and Montgomery Counties to protect care and keep services running\u2014no excuses, no delays.",
