                "text": "Across Maryland\u2019s Fourth District, thousands are bracing for skyrocketing premiums and devastating coverage losses because of the Republican health care crisis. During my visit to a @DaVita Dialysis center, I heard firsthand how these cuts would hit patients who rely on affordable, lifesaving care. We can\u2019t afford to go backward.",
