                "text": "Republicans shut down the government\u2014and now they want to take away your health care.\u2028\u2028Last week, I joined faith and Democratic leaders at a prayer vigil to stand up for families who can\u2019t afford to lose coverage. We\u2019re fighting to reopen government and protect care. https://t.co/HIlkvfDi3s",
